      "isPinned": false,
      "content": "Hi all / @Tim 'mithro' Ansell, I have a question about the CoB packaging option for Run 3.\n\nI don't need all 1000 dies packaged. I'd like a smaller batch on CoB for bring-up and testing, with the rest shipped as bare dies. From earlier messages, it sounds like in Run 1 some people received CoBs plus their remaining raw dies, but I couldn't find whether the number packaged can be chosen.\n\n1. Can we pick how many dies go onto CoB?\n2. Is pricing per packaged die, and is there a minimum quantity?\n3. If I start with a small batch, can more of my bare dies be packaged later?\n\nThanks!",
